Intentionally empty (SPEC-096 §6 R3/AC4).

The operating manual is host-global infrastructure the installer injects
directly into ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md (InjectManual) — it is NOT a profile block.
Migrating it here would make PinDefault inject a SECOND copy into the
project's own CLAUDE.md, diverging from vanilla's behaviour. This file only
exists so go:embed can see a non-empty blocks/ directory; it has no .md
extension, so profile.LoadContentsFS's block loader ignores it (0 blocks).
